atlas external

architecture incumbent-coordination-phenotypes
  canonical_name IncumbentCoordinationPhenotypes
  family external
  domain External / Institutional carriers
  layer compilation
  semantic_question Which incumbent platforms carry public material, institutional work, and authority boundaries without becoming the semantic owner of an Aurekai subject?
  purpose A compiler maps WordPress, moderated community, support, event, education, household-resource, resident-property, commerce, and neighborhood coordination bottlenecks into separately named subject roots, public carriers, and authority bridges. A receipt-bound materializer lowers public GitHub repositories to Project, Reddit/Discord records to observed CommunityBody, Meetup/Eventbrite records to PublicationOccurrence, and 211/Clever/property/Nextdoor records to ExternalResource; an ingest runner writes these native CMS owners and replay-updates them by their semantic external key. A separate ExternalResource Promotion compiler may lower a retained 211 resource with explicit public service classifications to HouseholdOpportunity, whose only current behavior is a private local save. It refuses private roles, payment, enrollment, eligibility, referral, and authority. A shared provider-connection compiler closes every carrier through observed, verified, connected, and revoked states: connection requires a named bridge-control proof plus a provider grant receipt naming its exact capabilities. WordPress is the first connected bridge: an installable read-only plugin signs a nonce-scoped HTTPS-site challenge with its pairing secret; every other authority bridge remains deferred.
  maturity implemented
  owns IncumbentCoordinationPhenotype
  publishes CoordinationClosure
  consumes SourceFrontier
  consumes ExternalAccountLink
  node_types CoordinationCarrier
  node_types AuthorityBridge
  edge_types participates_through
  edge_types verified_by_bridge
  invariant a phenotype separates public carrier, subject roots, and authority bridge; no provider account becomes a universal owner
  invariant only the WordPress bridge can currently verify installed-bridge control, and its proof is scoped to one clean HTTPS site and nonce
  invariant all deferred bridges remain named gaps, not claimed provider integrations
  invariant the five public carrier phenotypes share one ForeignTwin observation runner; it emits a normalized envelope only after the observer has retained both a body and a receipt, and the replay-safe CMS ingest delegates schema validation and writes to the native CMS owner
  forbidden_inference an installed WordPress bridge -> Actor identity, institutional authority, publication ownership, external OAuth grant, private data access, or a right to publish
  forbidden_inference a public Reddit, Discord, Patreon, Meetup, SIS, 211, property, marketplace, or neighborhood carrier -> membership, money movement, authority, or private-provider access
  source_path schemas/control/incumbent-coordination-phenotypes.json
  source_path cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/tools/compile_coordination_family.mjs
  source_path integrations/wordpress/bridge.mjs
  source_path integrations/wordpress/plugin/aurekai-bridge.php
  source_path cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/tools/materialize_incumbent_records.mjs
  source_path cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/tools/collect_public_carrier.mjs
  source_path cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/tools/promote_external_resource.mjs
  source_path cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/tools/ingest_incumbent_record.mjs
  source_path cmd/BonfyreCMS/content-types/external_participation_carrier.json
  source_path cmd/BonfyreCMS/content-types/external_provider_connection.json
  witness cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/tests/coordination_family.test.mjs
  witness integrations/wordpress/bridge.test.mjs
  witness integrations/wordpress/plugin.test.mjs
  witness cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/tests/incumbent_materialization.test.mjs
  witness cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/tests/public_carrier_collector.test.mjs
  witness cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/tests/incumbent_ingest_owner_test.sh
  witness cmd/BonfyreWebAddress/tests/github_foundry_closure_test.sh proves retained GitHub, Reddit, Discord, and Meetup public carrier fixtures are replay-safely ingested as Project, CommunityBody, or PublicationOccurrence and reach their exact signed-in native support, CommunityMembership-request, or local-occurrence-follow owner writes
  known_gap the plugin contract is statically tested but not yet exercised inside a WordPress runtime, and no CMS ceremony advances an institution claim from bridge-control verification.

interaction incumbent-coordination-phenotypes-uses-source-frontier
  source incumbent-coordination-phenotypes
  destination source-frontier
  relation maps_public_carriers
  preserves public carrier family, carrier endpoint class, and source standing
  drops provider-private state, authority, membership, and all effects
  forbidden_inference a public carrier mapping -> a callable source or institution connection
  invalidates_on a carrier declaration or SourceFrontier standing changing
  binding cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/tools/compile_coordination_family.mjs
  witness cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/tests/coordination_family.test.mjs

interaction incumbent-coordination-phenotypes-reaches-foundry-behavior
  source incumbent-coordination-phenotypes
  destination foundry-behavior-compiler
  relation materializes_subject_for_exact_behavior
  preserves retained carrier receipt reference, external semantic key, Project, CommunityBody, or PublicationOccurrence identity, and exact native owner contract
  drops provider-private membership, role, payment, authority, attendance, and every effect until the authenticated native owner receives an explicit action
  forbidden_inference a public GitHub, Reddit, Discord, or Meetup carrier materialized as a native subject -> carrier ownership, provider membership, external role, attendance, authority, or an automatic native action
  invalidates_on collector, materializer, CMS Project, CommunityBody, PublicationOccurrence, or OccurrenceFollow schema, Foundry behavior spec, AddressPlane subject lookup, or native support/community-request/occurrence-follow owner changing
  binding cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/tools/collect_public_carrier.mjs
  binding cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/tools/ingest_incumbent_record.mjs
  binding cmd/BonfyreCMS/tools/compile_foundry_behavior.mjs
  binding cmd/BonfyreWebAddress/src/main.c
  witness cmd/BonfyreWebAddress/tests/github_foundry_closure_test.sh
